Porting checklist from .NET/SQL to Nest.js/MongoDB
- Contract parity tests with golden .NET responses.
- Data extraction from SQL to XML/CSV; initial in-memory ingest.
- Feature flag to switch to Mongo; identical endpoints.
- Observability parity (structured logs, health, metrics).
- Container hardening and deployment manifests.

This plan provides a clear path to start with an in-memory XML-backed Nest/Express service, evaluate when to move to MongoDB, and containerize/deploy the resulting microservice to production with minimal risk.

